{
  "info": {
    "_postman_id": "recruit-api-collection",
    "name": "Recruit API Collection",
    "description": "Complete API collection for the Recruit application with job postings, applicant management, applications, reports, and AI interview system.\n\n## Quick Start Workflow:\n\n1. **Setup Users:**\n   - Register HR user: POST /api/users/register (role: 'hr')\n   - Register Applicant user: POST /api/users/register (role: 'applicant')\n   - Login users: POST /api/users/login\n\n2. **Create Job Posting:**\n   - Create job: POST /api/jobs (use HR user's _id as hrId)\n\n3. **Create Applicant Profile:**\n   - Create applicant profile: POST /api/applicants (use Applicant user's _id as userId)\n\n4. **Job Application Process:**\n   - Apply to job: POST /api/applications\n   - Start AI interview: POST /api/applications/{id}/start-interview\n   - Connect to WebSocket for interview: ws://localhost:5000\n\n5. **Review Results:**\n   - Get interview report: GET /api/reports/application/{applicationId}\n   - View job statistics: GET /api/reports/job/{jobId}/stats\n\n## Important Notes:\n- All IDs must be valid MongoDB ObjectIds (24-character hex strings)\n- HR users can create jobs and view reports\n- Applicant users can create profiles and apply to jobs\n- WebSocket connection required for AI interviews\n- Reports are auto-generated after interview completion",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
