    {
      "name": "WebSocket Documentation",
      "description": "WebSocket endpoints and message formats for AI interview system",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "WebSocket Connection Info",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Note",
                "value": "This is documentation only - WebSocket connections cannot be tested in Postman"
              }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "ws://{{wsBaseUrl}}",
              "protocol": "ws",
              "host": ["{{wsBaseUrl}}"]
            },
            "description": "WebSocket Connection Endpoint: ws://localhost:5000\n\nMessage Types:\n\n1. START INTERVIEW\n{\n  \"type\": \"start_interview\",\n  \"applicationId\": \"application_id_here\"\n}\n\n2. SEND TEXT MESSAGE\n{\n  \"type\": \"text_message\",\n  \"message\": \"Your answer to the interview question\"\n}\n\n3. END INTERVIEW\n{\n  \"type\": \"end_interview\"\n}\n\nResponse Types:\n\n1. INTERVIEW STARTED\n{\n  \"type\": \"interview_started\",\n  \"sessionId\": \"interview_session_id\",\n  \"message\": \"First interview question from AI\"\n}\n\n2. AI RESPONSE CHUNK (streaming)\n{\n  \"type\": \"ai_response_chunk\",\n  \"data\": \"Partial AI response text\"\n}\n\n3. AI RESPONSE COMPLETE\n{\n  \"type\": \"ai_response_complete\",\n  \"data\": \"Complete AI response text\"\n}\n\n4. INTERVIEW COMPLETED\n{\n  \"type\": \"interview_completed\",\n  \"message\": \"Interview completed successfully\"\n}\n\n5. INTERVIEW ENDED\n{\n  \"type\": \"interview_ended\",\n  \"message\": \"Interview ended successfully\"\n}\n\n6. ERROR\n{\n  \"type\": \"error\",\n  \"message\": \"Error description\"\n}\n\nUsage Flow:\n1. Connect to WebSocket endpoint\n2. Send start_interview message with applicationId\n3. Receive interview_started response with first question\n4. Send text_message responses to answer questions\n5. Receive ai_response_chunk messages (streaming AI responses)\n6. Continue until interview is completed (11 questions) or manually end\n7. Receive interview_completed when finished\n\nNote: The AI interview system uses streaming responses, so you'll receive multiple ai_response_chunk messages followed by ai_response_complete for each AI response."
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "Sample WebSocket Messages",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
